@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Save Test Case 1 input
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transporters/input
Content-Type: application/json

< ./test-case-1-input.json

### Save Test Case 2 input
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transporters/input
Content-Type: application/json

< ./test-case-2-input.json

### Save main example input
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transporters/input
Content-Type: application/json

< ./main-example-input.json

### Get stored input
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transporters/input

